item abi-bytes-native.bot seconds 0.086 status 0 cpu {0.072 0.008} result {backends {compile {excluded {CORE SEMANTIC NATIVE-ONLY: linux::write takes its payload's machine address (abi::x86_64::from_bytes) for the write(2) syscall, which the Tcl backends refuse at run time by design (tests/abi-bytes.test abi-bytes-tcl-backends-refuse-the-address pins the refusal); a refusal aborts a suite, so these tests run on cranelift-generic and cranelift only}}}}
